---
/**
 * Home "Our Approach": red band with the four steps over the pluckable strings.
 *
 * The rows are plain <div>s, not buttons: every panel is open at once, so a row
 * had nothing to reveal, and its only effect was to move a white highlight onto
 * the number: which read as a control that did not do anything.
 */
---

<section class="section approach-band">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow approach__eyebrow reveal">Our Approach</p>
    <div class="approach2 reveal" data-approach>
      <ol class="astep">
        <li class="astep__item" data-astep="0">
          <div class="astep__row">
            <span class="astep__num">1</span>
            <span class="astep__title">We Understand</span>
          </div>
          <div class="astep__panel"><div class="astep__panel-in">
            <p class="astep__desc">We begin by uncovering the realities behind a challenge. Through <strong>research, data collection, monitoring and evaluation, GIS mapping, and analytics</strong>, we generate evidence-based insights that help organisations make informed decisions.</p>
          </div></div>
        </li>
        <li class="astep__item" data-astep="1">
          <div class="astep__row">
            <span class="astep__num">2</span>
            <span class="astep__title">We Design</span>
          </div>
          <div class="astep__panel"><div class="astep__panel-in">
            <p class="astep__desc">Insights become stories, strategies, and experiences. We craft <strong>brands, communication systems, campaigns, publications, and narratives</strong> that simplify complexity, build trust, and align stakeholders around a shared vision.</p>
          </div></div>
        </li>
        <li class="astep__item" data-astep="2">
          <div class="astep__row">
            <span class="astep__num">3</span>
            <span class="astep__title">We Build</span>
          </div>
          <div class="astep__panel"><div class="astep__panel-in">
            <p class="astep__desc">Ideas create value only when they work in the real world. We develop <strong>websites, dashboards, SaaS products, AI tools, and digital platforms</strong> that transform strategies into practical, scalable, and user-centred solutions.</p>
          </div></div>
        </li>
        <li class="astep__item" data-astep="3">
          <div class="astep__row">
            <span class="astep__num">4</span>
            <span class="astep__title">Grow Together</span>
          </div>
          <div class="astep__panel"><div class="astep__panel-in">
            <p class="astep__desc">Growth is not just about visibility, it is about outcomes. Through <strong>strategic outreach, social media, lead generation, capacity building, and community engagement</strong>, we help organisations <strong>increase awareness, generate qualified leads,</strong> and create <strong>sustainable pathways for revenue and impact.</strong></p>
          </div></div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
